<div class="container wide" width="600" style="margin: 0 auto; text-align: <%= @direction[:align] %>; width: 600px;">
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We&rsquo;re reaching out to share an important update about Check: </span><strong>Check will no longer be available after November 1st, 2026.</strong></p>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We want to thank you for being part of Check. We&rsquo;re genuinely grateful for the time, trust, feedback, ideas, and partnership you&rsquo;ve shared with us over the years. Your work with Check has helped us learn a lot about how organizations can use technology to connect people with trusted information, and that learning is directly shaping what we&rsquo;re building next.</span></p>
	<p>&nbsp;</p>
	<p><strong>Why we&rsquo;re making this change</strong></p>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We&rsquo;re bringing our focus to Suwali, the evolution of this work.</span></p>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Suwali is built around a broader vision: helping mission-driven organizations </span><strong>inform, listen, and learn</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> at scale. It allows organizations to answer community questions using the content and sources they trust, while also creating opportunities to hear what communities are asking and sharing. That means moving from simply delivering information. Suwali is designed to help organizations learn from conversations with their communities and use those insights to direct their work.</span></p>
	<p><strong>What this means for you</strong></p>
	<p>&nbsp;</p>
	<ol>
	<li><strong> Explore Suwali</strong></li>
	</ol>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you&rsquo;re interested in migrating to our new product, Suwali, you can start your 30-day trial here. From within Suwali, you can later book a demo to discuss how it fits your organization&rsquo;s needs.</span></p>
	<ol start="2">
	<li><strong> Move on from Check</strong></li>
	</ol>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Once Check is discontinued, if you have a tipline number, it will be disconnected from Check and will be available for you to use elsewhere</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
	<p>&nbsp;</p>
	<p><strong>Your Check data</strong></p>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">All Check workspace admins will receive an email on November 2nd with a link to download a ZIP file containing an export of your workspace data.</span></p>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The export will include:</span></p>
	<ul>
	<ul>
		<li style="font-weight: 400;">
			<strong>Workspace information</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> - workspace name, URL, creation date, activity, users, and integrations</span>
		</li>
		<li style="font-weight: 400;">
			<strong>Users and access</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> - User names, emails, roles, join dates, and access information</span>
		</li>
		<li style="font-weight: 400;">
			<strong>Articles</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> - Article titles, summaries, URLs, languages, and report status</span>
		</li>
		<li style="font-weight: 400;">
			<strong>Claims, links, and media</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">: Titles, descriptions, dates, tags, status, sources, and media information</span>
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong><strong>Tipline requests: </strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">Submitted text, language, platform, date, and associated items</span></strong>
		</li>
		<li style="font-weight: 400;">
			<strong>Tasks and claim assessments</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">: Tasks and answers for each item</span>
		</li>
		<li style="font-weight: 400;">
			<strong>Newsletter and Annotation</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> -&nbsp;</span>
		</li>
	</ul>
	</ul>
	<p><strong>The download link will expire after 10 days</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">, so please download and securely store the file before it expires.</span></p>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Your Check workspace and data will remain available for another 10 days after the download link expires. After that date, Check data will be automatically deleted. Please download and securely store the export.</span></p>
	<p><strong>We&rsquo;re here to support you</strong></p>
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Thank you again for being part of Check and for everything you&rsquo;ve contributed along the way. We&rsquo;re proud of what we&rsquo;ve built together, and we&rsquo;re excited about carrying that work forward with Suwali.</span></p>
</div>